{"id":"399c5a186b3a5845","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion.md","title":"Theorem — 带计数器的参数原始递归","display":"Theorem — 带计数器的参数原始递归","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion","aliases":["14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion"],"display":"Theorem — 带计数器的参数原始递归","depends_on":["[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]]"],"source_location":"VI.1, printed 269; VI Exercise 1(i), printed 343; DjVu 140,177; derived strengthening","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 带计数器的参数原始递归"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6902dd0863cb754\" href=\"?note=c6902dd0863cb754\" title=\"14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration\">14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"VI.1, printed 269; VI Exercise 1(i), printed 343; DjVu 140,177; derived strengthening"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；以下范畴及 Hom 集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,z,s)\">\\((N,z,s)\\)</span> 为自然数对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为对象。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:X\\to Y\">\\(g:X\\to Y\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:(N\\times Y)\\times X\\to Y\">\\(h:(N\\times Y)\\times X\\to Y\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_N:N\\times X\\to N\">\\(\\pi_N:N\\times X\\to N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X\">\\(\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X\\)</span> 为投影；配对、积箭头见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6902dd0863cb754\" href=\"?note=c6902dd0863cb754\" title=\"14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration\">14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration</a> 所引定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times X,Y)\\;\\left(f\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_X,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle=g\\land f\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_X)=h\\circ\\langle\\langle\\pi_N,f\\rangle,\\pi_X\\rangle\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times X,Y)\\;\\left(f\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_X,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle=g\\land f\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_X)=h\\circ\\langle\\langle\\pi_N,f\\rangle,\\pi_X\\rangle\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>对目标对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\times Y\">\\(N\\times Y\\)</span> 使用参数迭代：初值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto(z,gx)\">\\(x\\mapsto(z,gx)\\)</span>，步进为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((n,y),x)\\mapsto(sn,h((n,y),x))\">\\(((n,y),x)\\mapsto(sn,h((n,y),x))\\)</span>。这些广义元素式分别是由投影和配对给出的合法箭头。得到唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:N\\times X\\to N\\times Y\">\\(q:N\\times X\\to N\\times Y\\)</span>。其第一分量和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_N\">\\(\\pi_N\\)</span> 都满足初值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z!_X\">\\(z!_X\\)</span>、步进 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\pi_N\">\\(s\\pi_N\\)</span>，由参数迭代唯一性相同；第二分量于是满足所列方程。反过来，任意候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_N\">\\(\\pi_N\\)</span> 配对都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的同一迭代方程，故相同。这是明确从原书参数练习推出的加强，未声称原书逐字给出。</p>\n<p>原稿记录曾读取原书 VI 练习 1（印刷 343，DjVu 177）并目视核对原图；原书仅提出练习，以下是独立解答。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"c6902dd0863cb754","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"c6902dd0863cb754","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$(N,z,s)$ 为自然数对象，$X,Y$ 为对象。给定 $g:X\\to Y$ 和 $h:(N\\times Y)\\times X\\to Y$。$\\pi_N:N\\times X\\to N$、$\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X$ 为投影；配对、积箭头见 [[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]] 所引定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"g:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"h:(N\\times Y)\\times X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_N:N\\times X\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X:N\\times X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times X,Y)\\;\\left(f\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_X,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle=g\\land f\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_X)=h\\circ\\langle\\langle\\pi_N,f\\rangle,\\pi_X\\rangle\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"N\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mapsto(z,gx)","display":false},{"tex":"((n,y),x)\\mapsto(sn,h((n,y),x))","display":false},{"tex":"q:N\\times X\\to N\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_N","display":false},{"tex":"z!_X","display":false},{"tex":"s\\pi_N","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_N","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false}],"bytes":2045,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion|thm-256 — 带计数器的参数原始递归]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-270","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-primitive-recursion|thm-256 — 带计数器的参数原始递归]]"}],"outgoing":["c6902dd0863cb754"]}